        "text_nFf469": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ensuring perfect fitment enhances performance, safety, and fuel efficiency. Here's how:</p><ul><li>Check your vehicle’s owner manual for recommended tire sizes.</li><li>Measure your existing tires’ sidewall for size verification.</li><li>Use our online fitment tool by simply entering your vehicle’s year, make, and model.</li><li>Reach out to our experts for custom fitment solutions for rare models.</li></ul>",
